      "id": "claim_7f0eba7a90644f6d86236dbac8bc6e41",
      "statement": "The PlatformAdapter seam still exists despite the web build being discontinued because App.tsx's isElectron() gate renders after React's hooks and module-level reads (getPlatform().getRecents() at store creation) already execute in a non-Electron runtime; something inert must answer those reads safely rather than throwing during module init.",
