      "statement": "createUnsupportedAdapter implements a small real object answering the two reads that genuinely happen before the gate (kind: 'browser', getRecents: () => []) and wraps it in a Proxy whose get-trap returns a function throwing 'SaiLoR for the web is discontinued — use the desktop app.' for every other property — one trap rather than ~30 individual stub methods.",
