      "statement": "ElectronAdapter delegates file operations to window.slr IPC handlers and serves PDFs via the custom slr-file://project/pdf protocol, resolving paths relative to a project directory set via setProjectDir on open/save-as; saveProject re-parses the logical whole-project text via loadProject, splits it with splitProjectFiles, and sends {metaText, files} over the project:save IPC.",
