      "id": "claim_717c46ddccb8414cb63d6eced3746dc2",
      "statement": "The app state lives in a Zustand store with immer middleware in src/state/store.ts (useStore), holding project, currentPaperId, saveHandle, undo/redo past/future stacks, theme, fontScale, pdfZoom, recents, aiMarks, reading position, self-update state, currentReviewer, and consolidation/screening UI state — including consolidationUpdatePrompt/consolidationUpdateApproved, the paper-id pair driving the ConsolidationUpdatePrompt modal; the store reads getPlatform().getRecents() at module load for its initial recents.",
