      "statement": "currentTree(project, currentReviewer, paper, create?) is the single routing decision every mutating action and reader goes through: single-reviewer → paper.annotations; Consolidation → paper.annotations (the tree that ships); a numbered reviewer → paper.reviews[N]; nobody picked on a multi-reviewer project → null. Mutating actions pass create=true (safe inside immer set) while read-only computations pass nothing.",
